  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mpepa Soy Marketing Promotion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Soy beans..Beneficiaries: 360 smallholder farmers..Location: Chinsinga, Malawi..Description: The grant will enable Mpepa Producers and Marketing Cooperative to sustain growth by funding improved seeds and other agricultural inputs, a crop purchase fund to enable Mpepa to buy more soy beans from farmers, farming equipment, as well as production and management training to strengthen the cooperative and its members.</narrative>
  </description>
